{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-lum1nar-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"lum1nar-tower-2-object-1-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","about":"LUM1NAR Tower 2 is the second tower of the residential complex from the developer Object One Real Estate Development. The complex itself consists of three towers with a height of 25 residential floors, located in the popular Jumeirah Village Triangle area. Every corner of LUM1NAR Tower 2 is a testament to architectural sophistication and charm, with every detail imbued with wonder and beauty. In the second tower there are 196 apartments with 1 and 1.5 bedrooms. The interiors are designed in a modern style using soft colors, which creates a cozy atmosphere, while the apartments have thoughtful layouts with spacious rooms.Residents can enjoy world-class premium amenities: gym, swimming pool with lounge area, children's pool, children's playroom, outdoor playground, yoga studio, sauna, and barbecue area. The technology of the future, the Smart Home system, is also provided.Conveniently located in the Jumeirah Village Triangle, the development is located at the intersection of Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road with Al Khail Road, adjacent to the coastal areas to Jumeirah Island, Palm Jumeirah and Palm Jebel Ali, allowing easy access to all areas of Dubai and other emirates. Jumeirah Golf Estates Golf Course and Montgomerie Golf Course are just 15 minutes away by car. Circle Mall, Dubai Hills Mall and Mall of the Emirates are 15-17 minutes away. Retail outlets, schools, kindergartens, medical institutions, cafes and restaurants are within walking distance.EOI: from 30 000 AEDLaunch date: to be announced later","price":5160012,"title":"LUM1NAR Tower 2","bitrix":{"id":776,"pf_id":"are.3.14498","source":null,"project_id":"Lum1nar","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"LUM1NAR Tower 2","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Object 1","pr